{"unit_id":"AdRainty__dsh-vocechat-bridge#card-zh","repo":"AdRainty/dsh-vocechat-bridge","commit":"c3c70e189e62feaf2b6defcd7d77697e8caed499","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vocechat-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 VoceChat 桥接插件，可将 VoceChat 私聊和群聊接入已有的固定 DSH 会话。它通过 Webhook 接收消息，并注册发送、历史查询和状态工具；消息可携带图片、音频及文件，也可按需使用语音识别和合成。插件支持白名单、消息缓冲与会话历史背景，适合希望从 VoceChat 与 DSH 会话交互的用户。使用需配置 VoceChat Bot、已有 Session 和允许的用户或群组；语音服务可选配置 OpenAI 或小米 MiMo。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:50","src/tools.ts:54","src/bridge.ts:111"]}
{"unit_id":"AdRainty__dsh-vocechat-bridge#card-en","repo":"AdRainty/dsh-vocechat-bridge","commit":"c3c70e189e62feaf2b6defcd7d77697e8caed499","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vocechat-bridge connects VoceChat chats to an existing DSH session. Its Webhook receives messages; DSH tools send text and media, read history, and request speech synthesis. Optional recognition and allowlists are supported. Configure a VoceChat Bot and session; speech services are optional.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:50","src/tools.ts:54","src/bridge.ts:111"]}
